  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to AFRITAC West 2 - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The programme aims to strengthen the institutional and human capacities of 6 States of the WA region for effective macroeconomic management in the areas of competence of the AFRITAC. The capacity development activities aim to improve the design, implementation, and monitoring of sound macroeconomic, financial, fiscal and monetary policies, and enhanced regional harmonisation, in alignment with the regional objectives of Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
